      "title": "Full-Stack Developer & Business Solutions Specialist",
      "bio": "I build premium digital products — from custom websites and e-commerce platforms to advanced POS/ERP systems and AI-driven search visibility. Turning business problems into reliable software.",
      "about": "I'm a Full-Stack Developer and Business Solutions Specialist with hands-on experience building production software used by real businesses. My work spans custom websites, e-commerce platforms, and advanced POS/ERP systems built on a solid PHP + MySQL foundation, alongside modern React + Node.js applications.\n\nOver the years I've shipped complete business management software for retail, pharmacy, fashion, grocery and restaurant industries — software that handles real sales, real inventory, and real money.",
      "approach": "Business-first development: I start from the actual workflow a business runs every day, then design software that removes friction instead of adding it. Clean architecture, real validation, and interfaces that people can actually use.",
